id":"pucci_p8_187","t":"Distinction wrote: Hello pucci, if you don't mind me asking. Are you consistently profitable? Just curious. It is always good to hear success stories.\n\nHi there,\n\nTo be honest with you this cannot be a yes or no answer. Profitability is a byproduct of one's hard work. For me it is more about where to enter, exit, and sl placement. Everything you need to become a super-trader is right here in this forum.\n\nBelow is an example...\n\nBest of luck with your studies","a":"pucci","d":"","n":"#187","p":8,"im":["ce2d576b07a24fd51277276b0663a80fbc062b8f"],"m":187},{"id":"pucci_p8_188","t":"Thank you for the answer.\n\nI actually changed my mindset to exactly what you said just a few days ago. Execution instead of just profits.\n\nWhy isn't your TP for trades 1-3 1 RBD lower(the one after 12.15)?","a":"Distinction","d":"","n":"#188","p":8,"im":[],"m":188},{"id":"pucci_p8_189","t":"Distinction wrote: Thank you for the answer.\n\nI actually changed my mindset to exactly what you said just a few days ago. Execution instead of just profits.\n\nWhy isn't your TP for trades 1-3 1 RBD lower(the one after 12.15)?\n\nNow it will be, in the next leg down... I wanted to see intention. Also I like to start off the week/month with taking full TP at first target. As the day/week goes by I venture deeper into the zones while taking partials. Next short targets are 206 followed by 065, 9910 and 9450.\n\nHope this helps,","a":"pucci","d":"","n":"#189","p":8,"im":[],"m":189},{"id":"pucci_p8_190","t":"Hi, just realized you had 1-3 trades in both long and short. I meant the long trades to the left.","a":"Distinction","d":"","n":"#190","p":8,"im":[],"m":190},{"id":"pucci_p8_191","t":"Distinction wrote: Hi, just realized you had 1-3 trades in both long and short. I meant the long trades to the left.\n\nCould you please rephrase your question on a chart... it would clarify what it is you are asking cause I still don't get it.\n\nThanks","a":"pucci","d":"","n":"#191","p"